\begin{proposition}
  \label{prop:vertex_edge_tree_equality}
  \notready
  Let $G=(V,E)$ be a connected finite graph. Then, $|G|=\#V=\#E+1$ if and only if $G$ is a plane tree.
  \uses{prop:vertex_edge_inequality}
\end{proposition}

n387.content:
