    \left|\int P_\epsilon\,d\mu_{X_n} - \int P_\epsilon\,d\sigma_1\right| >\epsilon/3,$ or $\left|\int P_\epsilon\,d\sigma_1 - \int f\,d\sigma_1\right|>\epsilon/3$.
